Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.74,0:01:27.60,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Me dá vontade de correr pela multidão agitada
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:33.56,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}As pessoas enchem as ruas de novo, como se tivessem sido chamadas aqui
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.99,0:01:38.44,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Ver todo mundo dizendo "Volte sempre!" me deixa tão orgulhosa
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.79,0:01:44.91,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Com as expectativas crescendo, estou explodindo de empolgação
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.21,0:01:48.04,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Ficando bem ereta
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:50.56,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Desculpe, te fiz esperar?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:54.75,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Quando vejo esses sorrisos passando, quero abraçar essas pessoas
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.75,0:01:55.88,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Bem forte
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.79,0:02:01.84,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Entrem, pessoal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.84,0:02:04.55,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}O começo sempre chega,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.55,0:02:09.58,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}A gente já sai correndo sem perceber
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.58,0:02:12.73,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Quase como se cada festa acontecesse
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:15.60,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Numa névoa brilhante
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.79,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Não é este lugar tão brilhante?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:23.19,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Venham dar uma olhada!
