Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.71,0:21:59.31,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Girando, girando, um disco
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.31,0:22:02.82,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Se a agulha pular no sulco
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.82,0:22:07.72,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}As notas vão soar meio cortadas
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.34,0:22:15.02,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Se eu não conseguir consertar com meu secador, vou ficar em apuros
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.36,0:22:21.44,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}A gente conversou demais ontem à noite
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.21,0:22:29.76,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Quando tentei tirar minhas lentes de contato,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.34,0:22:35.00,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}O mundo ficou todo embaçado
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.93,0:22:43.92,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Eu parei um segundo pra olhar ao redor e ver onde eu estava
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.92,0:22:51.93,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Será que tudo isso vai desaparecer de mim um dia?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.34,0:22:57.81,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}As coisas que procuramos
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.89,0:23:01.44,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Estão sempre escondidas bem ao nosso lado
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.44,0:23:07.38,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Mesmo que você não consiga ver e tenha que senti-las
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.78,0:23:12.01,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Ah, girando, girando, um disco
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.01,0:23:15.53,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}A agulha pula no sulco
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.53,0:23:20.90,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Mas escute isso, que melodia curiosa
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.81,0:23:24.55,ED-TL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur2.5}Tenho certeza de que nunca vou esquecê-la
